        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeffrey Jones\n- Works: The Revolutionary, Ferris Bueller's Day Off, Beetlejuice, The Hunt for Red October, Deadwood\n- Roles: Edward R. Rooney, Charles Deetz, Skip Tyler, A.W. Merrick\n\nFacts:\n- Jeffrey Duncan Jones was born on September 28, 1946, and is an American actor.\n- The Revolutionary was the film debut of actor Jeffrey Jones.\n- In 1986, Jeffrey Jones played Edward R. Rooney in Ferris Bueller's Day Off.\n- In 1988, Jeffrey Jones played Charles Deetz in Beetlejuice.\n- In 1990, Jeffrey Jones played Skip Tyler in The Hunt for Red October.\n- From 2004 to 2006, Jeffrey Jones played A.W. Merrick in Deadwood.",
